# m7_power (M7 power loss, PLAN.md M7 "Player"): a hit that triggers the auto rewind costs one
# weapon level (never below 1) and one fork (never below 0) at the resume, plus 80 mercy;
# hold-B rewinds and the retry shield cost no power. Input: m6_retry's (the sweep in god mode
# to collect F5, two forks and the shield; god off at 5000; RIGHT 5150..5200 into the
# Heisenbug) plus a hold-B at 5100..5109.
# - Hold-B 5100..5109 (20 ticks, fuel 180 -> 160): F5 and two forks before, during (5109,
#   tick 4972) and after the release (5110): no cost.
# - 5154 (tick 5016): the retry shield absorbs a hit: shield 0, still F5 and two forks.
# - 5238 (tick 5100): rammed, auto rewind to 4980 (rewinds 2). The playback frames show the
#   restored World (5317: F5, forks 2, the shield back); the resume at 5318 charges the cost:
#   F5 -> F4 (weapon 5 -> 4), forks 2 -> 1, mercy 0 -> 80.
# - 5378: the restored shield absorbs again: F4, forks 1 kept.
# - 5630: hit (rewinds 1), resume at 5710: F4 -> F3, forks 1 -> 0, mercy 73 -> 153.
# - 5835: hit (rewinds 0), resume at 5915: F3 -> F2, forks stay 0, mercy 153 -> 233.
# m6_retry_hc pins the same cost in a hardcore game. debug_history_check is 0 after each
# resume and during the hold.
--frames 5950 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "5000 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_rewinds,debug_mercy --at "5099 debug_weapon == 5" --at "5099 debug_forks == 2" --at "5100 debug_state == 5" --at "5109 debug_state == 5" --at "5109 debug_game_tick == 4972" --at "5109 debug_weapon == 5" --at "5109 debug_forks == 2" --at "5109 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5110 debug_state == 1" --at "5110 debug_weapon == 5" --at "5110 debug_forks == 2" --at "5110 debug_mercy == 0" --at "5153 debug_shield == 1" --at "5154 debug_shield == 0" --at "5154 debug_state == 1" --at "5154 debug_weapon == 5" --at "5154 debug_forks == 2" --at "5238 debug_state == 4" --at "5238 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "5238 debug_rewind_target == 4980" --at "5317 debug_state == 4" --at "5317 debug_weapon == 5" --at "5317 debug_forks == 2" --at "5318 debug_state == 1" --at "5318 debug_game_tick == 4980" --at "5318 debug_weapon == 4" --at "5318 debug_forks == 1" --at "5318 debug_mercy == 80" --at "5320 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5378 debug_shield == 0" --at "5378 debug_weapon == 4" --at "5378 debug_forks == 1" --at "5630 debug_rewinds == 1" --at "5709 debug_weapon == 4" --at "5710 debug_weapon == 3" --at "5710 debug_forks == 0" --at "5710 debug_mercy == 153" --at "5720 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5835 debug_rewinds == 0" --at "5914 debug_weapon == 3" --at "5915 debug_state == 1" --at "5915 debug_weapon == 2" --at "5915 debug_forks == 0" --at "5915 debug_mercy == 233" --at "5930 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_weapon == 2"
